    <string name="guide_step1_title">Step 1 of 2: allow scripts</string>
    <string name="guide_step1_text">To add automation to your spreadsheet, turn on \"Google Apps Script API\" in your Apps Script settings. Tap Open, switch it on, then come back to the app.</string>
    <string name="guide_step2_title">Step 2 of 2: enable automation</string>
    <string name="guide_step2_private_text">Tap Open: a private browser tab opens. Sign in there as %1$s, then tap Review permissions → Advanced → Go to workout_rec_automation → Allow. Then come back to the app.</string>
    <string name="guide_step2_copy_text">Your browser can\'t open this page in a private tab. Tap Copy link, open a new incognito (private) tab in your browser, sign in there as %1$s and paste the link. Then tap Review permissions → Advanced → Go to workout_rec_automation → Allow, and come back to the app.</string>
